ake a digital breath test.  There are mistakes in these devices also, after all they are technolgo that need to be maintained and specialized training on hours a week.  The incarceration is taped at the time the officer turns on their red and blues.  It is through this taped footage that we are able to inform an learned opinion on the officer administration of the tests, to the accused performance taking the tests. Whether you consent to the checks or not, you usually will go to jail. If you have been arrested for Assualt or any criminal charges or know some one who  needs a criminal defense Lawyer visit my site here warren county ohio dui attorney best regards|-_-|textarea_-_', '2022-09-24', '1'),
